## Dependencies

None beyond the system frameworks (AudioToolbox, AudioUnit, CoreAudio,
CoreMIDI, Cocoa, CoreAudioKit, Foundation) and the C++11 standard library
for the portable core. No third-party plugin frameworks are used
(brief §18).
